"if :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` =2 inclusion zones overlap, a fence "
"breach will occur when crossing a boundary, even if within another "
"inclusion zone, UNLESS :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` bit 1 is set "
"to make all inclusions zones a union set."
