#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:84
#: 530ee213dde7488abad09cdf3c304dd1
msgid "Set :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11 (Fence Enable)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11（围栏启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:85
#: 26c4beae4faa471db4ea980bf4d0ae1a
msgid ""
"setting the switch high (i.e. PWM > 1800) will enable all configured "
"fences, low (under 1800) will disable all fences."
msgstr "将开关拨高（即 PWM > 1800）将启用所有已配置的围栏，拨低（低于 1800）将禁用所有围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:88
#: 2f03d4284a33472281587b48e266183c
msgid ""
"if the Minimun Altitude fence is enabled by the switch while on the "
"ground and disarmed, a pre-arm failure will occur preventing arming."
msgstr "如果在地面且未解锁时通过开关启用最低高度围栏，将发生解锁前失败，阻止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:91
#: 681bbd298ad54990a41a463f6df4bf27
msgid "Automatic Altitude Breach Avoidance"
msgstr "自动高度突破规避"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:93
#: 510cd3540fdb4602b6a7590c5d906d4c
msgid ""
"For landing modes (NAV_LAND,QLAND,LAND,etc.) in Copter and Plane, the "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` limit is automatically disabled."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 和固定翼的降落模式（NAV_LAND、QLAND、LAND "
"等），:ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` 限制将自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:98
#: b9f1c0a2d4ec47359050266f374e06e4
msgid ""
"altitude control imperfections can still result in a breach unless the "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` param is loose enough to accommodate "
"these imperfections."
msgstr "高度控制不完善仍可能导致突破，除非 :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` 参数足够宽松以适应这些不完善之处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:102
#: 0d8b50d792264ccdb6730f2bfcb01544
msgid "Enabling Fences in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:104
#: 7f98e7ff43c94aae8da08f9a4fb8e0c8
msgid ""
"To enable Fences, go to the Mission Planner full parameter list "
"(CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree), search for items with ``FENCE_``:"
msgstr ""
"要启用围栏，请进入 Mission Planner 完整参数列表（CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree），搜索带 "
"``FENCE_`` 的项目："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:118
#: 55c713aa8e7e4f1299f12d7a3e61b3ae
msgid "Use for R/C Training"
msgstr "用于 RC 训练"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:120
#: 93f983ed163a49a6af9f443e316c6a5f
msgid ""
"One of the main uses of geo-fencing is to teach yourself (or someone "
"else) to fly radio controlled vehicles. When you have a properly "
"configured geo-fence it is very hard to crash, and you can try manoeuvres"
" that would normally be too likely to end in a crash, trusting the "
"autopilot to 'bounce' the vehicle off the geo-fence before the flight "
"ends in disaster."
msgstr "地理围栏的主要用途之一是教自己（或他人）驾驶遥控飞行器。当您正确配置了地理围栏后，坠机变得非常困难，您可以尝试平时风险太高的动作，信任飞控会在飞行灾难发生前将飞行器「弹回」地理围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:127
#: b120f974d8ea4bc1bed10f54d092fc06
msgid ""
"Geo-fencing can be combined with any flight mode. So for a raw beginner, "
"you would combine it with one of the stabilised flight modes . Once the "
"pilot has gained some confidence you could combine it with ACRO mode in "
"Copter or MANUAL mode in Plane, which gives direct control of the vehicle"
" and allows for the most interesting aerobatic manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏可与任何飞行模式结合使用。对于初学者，可与某种增稳飞行模式结合使用。当飞手获得一定信心后，可与 Copter 中的 Acro "
"模式或固定翼中的 MANUAL 模式结合使用，这可直接控制飞行器并允许最有趣的特技动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:134
#: bf58e785c9e0477ea94c7c89ebc0f442
