"FENCE_STATUS，在「ardupilotmega.xml」中定义。典型的 FENCE_STATUS 数据包如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:144
#: dc95e9c22273405ab7bfd7a2ba38d444
msgid ""
"The breach_status field is 0 if inside the fence, and 1 if outside. The "
"breach_count is how many fence breaches you have had on this flight. The "
"breach_type is the type of the last breach (see the FENCE_BREACH enum in "
"ardupilotmega.xml). The breach_time is the time in milliseconds of the "
"breach since APM was booted."
msgstr ""
"breach_status 字段在围栏内时为 0，在围栏外时为 1。breach_count 是本次飞行中围栏突破的次数。breach_type "
"是最近一次突破的类型（见 ardupilotmega.xml 中的 FENCE_BREACH 枚举）。breach_time 是自 APM "
"启动以来突破发生的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:150
#: 4335fafb76e14e86a008a52658b01759
msgid ""
"The MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE bit of the MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR portion of "
"the SYS_STATUS message indicates whether or not the geo-fence is "
"breached.  As of this writing only the MAVProxy GCS recognizes this "
"status bit and reports the status of the geo-fence.  In the future the "
"Mission Planner, APM Planner, and other GCS applications should get "
"support for announcing geo-fence status during the flight."
msgstr ""
"SYS_STATUS 消息的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR 部分中的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE "
"位指示地理围栏是否被突破。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy GCS 识别此状态位并报告地理围栏状态。未来 Mission "
"Planner、APM Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序应获得在飞行期间宣布地理围栏状态的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:157
#: 3d8fa13e8fe24a4987a5738ccbcb5d0b
msgid ""
"The MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink command message allows a GCS to "
"enable or disable a fence interactively.  As of this writing only "
"MAVProxy supports this message using the \"fence enable\" or \"fence "
"disable\" commands.  In the future Mission Planner, APM Planner, and "
"other GCS applications may get support for interactively enabling and "
"disabling the geo-fence without needing to use a manual transmitter."
msgstr ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink 命令消息允许 GCS 以交互方式启用或禁用围栏。截至本文撰写时，仅 "
"MAVProxy 支持此消息，使用「fence enable」或「fence disable」命令。未来 Mission Planner、APM "
"Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序可能会获得无需使用手动遥控器即可交互式启用和禁用地理围栏的支持。"

